Done when:
  The app starts in local Docker with `AIKANA_PASSWD` set and serves both calendar views.
  Data written by the admin survives a container restart through the `./data` volume.
  `uv run pytest` passes.
  `docker build --target test .` passes.
  `specdd lint` passes.
